{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p001492","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p001492","cbr-p001902"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p001492","label":"申叔時（楚使者）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"申叔時","mention_ids":["c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0056"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0056","chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p017","quote":"申叔時"}]},{"id":"cbr-p001902","label":"申叔時（楚莊王使者）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"申叔時","mention_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu:m023-0036"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m023-0036","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p023","quote":"申叔時"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-036-chenqi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-036","chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0056"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-036-chenqi:p017"],"passage_count":1},{"source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-040","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu:m023-0036"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu:p023"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-036-chenqi","s-shiji-040-chu"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"申叔時","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001492","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p017","chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m023-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"申叔時","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001902","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p023","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji036-091","person_id":"cbr-p001492","surfaces":["申叔時"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-036-chenqi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p017","quote":"成公元年冬，楚莊王為夏徵舒殺靈公，率諸侯伐陳。謂陳曰：「無驚，吾誅徵舒而已。」已誅徵舒，因縣陳而有之，群臣畢賀。申叔時使於齊來還，獨不賀。莊王問其故，對曰：「鄙語有之，牽牛徑人田，田主奪之牛。徑則有罪矣，奪之牛，不亦甚乎？今王以徵舒為賊弒君，故徵兵諸侯，以義伐之，已而取之，以利其地，則後何以令於天下！是以不賀。」莊王曰：「善。」乃迎陳靈公太子午於晉而立之，復君陳如故，是為成公。孔子讀史記至楚復陳，曰：「賢哉楚莊王！輕千乘之國而重一言。」"}],"rationale":"本篇第17段按明示名與稱號、陳／杞世系及具體敘事暫定「申叔時」同指；引句均保留，不按同名字面跨篇合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji040-shenshushi","person_ids":["cbr-p001492","cbr-p001902"],"canonical_person_id":"cbr-p001492","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-036-chenqi","c-shiji-040-chu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","source_id":"s-shiji-036-chenqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p017","quote":"成公元年冬，楚莊王為夏徵舒殺靈公，率諸侯伐陳。謂陳曰：「無驚，吾誅徵舒而已。」已誅徵舒，因縣陳而有之，群臣畢賀。申叔時使於齊來還，獨不賀。莊王問其故，對曰：「鄙語有之，牽牛徑人田，田主奪之牛。徑則有罪矣，奪之牛，不亦甚乎？今王以徵舒為賊弒君，故徵兵諸侯，以義伐之，已而取之，以利其地，則後何以令於天下！是以不賀。」莊王曰：「善。」乃迎陳靈公太子午於晉而立之，復君陳如故，是為成公。孔子讀史記至楚復陳，曰：「賢哉楚莊王！輕千乘之國而重一言。」","mention_ids":["c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0056"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p023","quote":"十六年，伐陳，殺夏徴舒。徴舒弒其君，故誅之也。已破陳，卽縣之。群臣皆賀，申叔時使齊來，不賀。王問，對曰：「鄙語曰，牽牛徑人田，田主取其牛。徑者則不直矣，取之牛不亦甚乎？且王以陳之亂而率諸侯伐之，以義伐之而貪其縣，亦何以復令於天下！」莊王乃復國陳後。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu:m023-0036"]}],"rationale":"兩篇申叔時使齊來還不賀楚縣陳，並以牽牛徑田的相同諫辭促成復陳，暫同指；既有ID保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p017","text":"成公元年冬，楚莊王為夏徵舒殺靈公，率諸侯伐陳。謂陳曰：「無驚，吾誅徵舒而已。」已誅徵舒，因縣陳而有之，群臣畢賀。申叔時使於齊來還，獨不賀。莊王問其故，對曰：「鄙語有之，牽牛徑人田，田主奪之牛。徑則有罪矣，奪之牛，不亦甚乎？今王以徵舒為賊弒君，故徵兵諸侯，以義伐之，已而取之，以利其地，則後何以令於天下！是以不賀。」莊王曰：「善。」乃迎陳靈公太子午於晉而立之，復君陳如故，是為成公。孔子讀史記至楚復陳，曰：「賢哉楚莊王！輕千乘之國而重一言。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"成公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001490","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"楚莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000257","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"夏徵舒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001399","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001485","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"徵舒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001399","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"徵舒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001399","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"申叔時","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001492","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000257","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"田主","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"徵舒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001399","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-c